=2 Walkthrough
* You must wait a game day after completing {q:Do Not Go Into the Light|Do Not Go Into the Light|Do Not Go Into the Light} before flagging this quest.
* Click on the door to {n:Svenja's Manor|Door: Svenja's Manor} at (I-8) in {z:Western Adoulin}.
