*** {i:Frost Turnip|Frost Turnip|4382} can be farmed from rabbits in {z:Kamihr Drifts} or {z:Uleguerand Range}, or can be bought from your {n:Green Thumb Moogle} if you've been working with your Mog Garden and received the {k:White rabbit memento} from {p:Monster Rearing}.
